 with activated charcoal from volcanic sources, these jet-black flakes deliver a deep, earthy complexity that instantly elevates any dish. More than a seasoning, Flakey Black is a statement piece in your culinary arsenal: dramatic in appearance, refined in flavor, and essential for chefs and home cooks looking to add depth, artistry, and a touch of the extraordinary to every plate.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcTXwdBY-JMC7GodPYjK3eIfAjX9YNyU5ZclI9VK2Ohbd_K118Daei6H7B4pOdrhF3VNMACZ5to","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcSHc3nrRdPFuUjOQCl14sLr-Gg2F6AqEsI2yBcwYR2btY28dP0HVFjW9WeB4PcLUHzVLY4ixrQ","width":256,"height":256},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcRuOpF2OcRM598yluPb557_Q2izr0X_MakWaziIzo9w9f56JVE7bR8PyO2SJYoTAgfoLBMFsLq8","width":512,"height":512}],"placeholderColor":4294967295},"price":"$14.99","vendorName":"Osmo Kitchen","trackingParams":"CJYCEJP0ARgAIhMI3Py1ufCZlwMVjpnLAR11OzZb","buttonText":"Shop","buttonCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CJYCEJP0ARgAIhMI3Py1ufCZlwMVjpnLAR11OzZbygEEfYoqKQ==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams":"CJYCEJP0ARgAIhMI3Py1ufCZlwMVjpnLAR11OzZbygEEfYoqKQ==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"sendPost":true,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/feedback"}},"feedbackEndpoint":{"feedbackToken":"AB9zfpIuoro-9aIN1gnvHNoDt-et3h0l1c8T4sdQk5DiUfMfAjrHIvspbGPWz0jhXf3uLstz7epxc1vC3hB39CG58qndPkvpb0MvgTmLh6V5JXneK0bqeA8J5VJr8i3pJ5JTMvd32SJdWVSUg1zzg6D25GwaXKWUCVnxqJRLut55QZgfWzgjgt-04JAxAmUra9Su430FyKpEur5ZHroIHaEDZ-47ux1erVsECCGbhIbVQLAoRdJfPWHknz0Ev3aLQvxNWUPvqXu3Usqu8IntvfihLHTWCutRB84LeUWleQERMIpc59C0nhTX5PIhZWIwNpuBccCh7xfbsA81kTyeknVibJfNAAARAJK5yhVNJa5_Q3MFotBsm_bn7HJJLl3-0Q-1HJpxP5cGDRdabuDts4rvxf15GSDNQz6e2nP3uh_F8V0RcYgRcSo3BcxyvfjEGdspidz2Wi2HjSM13CektN70P_C6vt57TPSB46q8V_Ld0WOk6CAXw9ekeAD5ix1f1VEzd7yw0xC4T2Gf6YeG0SeR2Q3tk3LfRp8vNsaxOBc8JHcicbDq1GgeHPtKMfw2iuLD5CgFI2GHmAuPXDE